<title>UK: Air France Port Harcourt service starts.</title>
<headline>Air France Port Harcourt service starts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France launched a non-stop weekly service to Port Harcourt in Nigeria from Paris Charles de Gaulle on Tuesday January 21, the airline said in a statement.</p>
<p>The airline said it is the first European airline to serve Port Harcourt and will use a 747-200 Combi.</p>
<p>Outward bound flights leave Paris on Tuesday with the return flight landing back at CDG on a Thursday morning. The French carrier already operates a three times a week service to Lagos. -- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
